              "assessment": "RGBA byte metric compares each full4byte pixel to first-pixel RGB with summed absolute threshold12; remainder ignored. Foreground ratio uses checked multiplication/division,0 on missing/short/overflow and clamp10000 before u16. Luminance weighted encoded-channel bytes(.2126/.7152/.0722) in f64, missing/no fullpixels=>NaN; not physical linear-light measurement. Readback hash FNV1a64 accepts any byte slice (empty included), intended compact nonadversarial witness. Equality is hash comparison, not mathematically collision-free byte comparison; no concrete capture collision asserted. Actual native image format/row stride/dimensions required."
